pi-chat-view

This project ports logic from Collie (https://github.com/AltanS/collie):
tool-call classification (bridge/journal/tool-call.ts), the Pi session mapping
(bridge/journal/pi.ts), chat items (web/src/lib/chat-items.ts), and run folding,
summaries and step lines (web/src/components/chat-cards.tsx, i18n en.ts).
Ported code lives under src/model/ and is marked in its file headers.

